{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/cba2826b433959d2547445e7222d603f.avif?t=1771599528\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's roll the bones!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced, action-packed roguelite you will need to carefully choose a <strong>loadout of spell-dice</strong> to conquer each dungeon floor.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/54069ccc32f88b1bc566dd543fd1a2d7.poster.avif?t=1771599528\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/54069ccc32f88b1bc566dd543fd1a2d7.webm?t=1771599528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/54069ccc32f88b1bc566dd543fd1a2d7.mp4?t=1771599528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/2c70c84277042a1967e1734540db5996.webp?t=1771599528\" width=616 height=24 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's the deal with dice?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each die has 6 sides, and each side can hold a different spell. Some are good, some are terrible, and some will straight-up annihilate the enemies (or even yourself).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing the right dice for each dungeon floor is the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/b3a532121ca6b943711b7921494f90e3.poster.avif?t=1771599528\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/b3a532121ca6b943711b7921494f90e3.webm?t=1771599528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/b3a532121ca6b943711b7921494f90e3.mp4?t=1771599528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/2c70c84277042a1967e1734540db5996.webp?t=1771599528\" width=616 height=24 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactable spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from a wide variety of dice and change how they behave on <strong>Critical rolls</strong>. Go for damage, hit effects, combos or even pure chaos. Spells vary wildly in stats, effects, and even their physics! Throughout the run collect rare modifiers that will further influence the spell's behavior. Combine all those choices to annihilate your enemies!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/3dfd2d795bd6c03b78a9aa35be4d17ba.poster.avif?t=1771599528\" width=616 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/3dfd2d795bd6c03b78a9aa35be4d17ba.webm?t=1771599528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/3dfd2d795bd6c03b78a9aa35be4d17ba.mp4?t=1771599528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/2c70c84277042a1967e1734540db5996.webp?t=1771599528\" width=616 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade &amp; Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load special Artifacts by racking up combo scores. Trigger them mid-run like ultimate abilities to power up your loadout - Artifacts offer a variety of effects, from mild ones like boosting your speed to thunderstorms or meteor rains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/651d32f477fc42cbbfa8beee5de85649.poster.avif?t=1771599528\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/651d32f477fc42cbbfa8beee5de85649.webm?t=1771599528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/651d32f477fc42cbbfa8beee5de85649.mp4?t=1771599528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/2c70c84277042a1967e1734540db5996.webp?t=1771599528\" width=616 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527550/extras/d658cdab0b41bdeb2c077e1570f5ae65.avif?t=1771599528\" width=616 height=368 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2527550?t=1771599528","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass